      "note": "Empty projection: the daemon's bare [] (plus x-has-more:false) is byte-identical to the SDK's declared array; this is the one session surface that passes with no messages.",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/session/@string/message",
        "query": "limit=10"
